# install.sh creates /var/lib/zorcam-nvr/config/secrets.env (mode 600, user zorcam-nvr) from this file.
# Camera passwords are saved here by the gallery (setup wizard, Settings -> camera), one line per camera:
#   ZORCAM_CAMERA_PASSWORD_<ID>=...   (the camera ID in capitals, - becomes _: front-door -> FRONT_DOOR)
# The camera addresses and logins are in cameras.json. Never commit a filled-in copy.

# Gallery users are not here but in users.json: the setup wizard creates admin, the other users are added
# on Settings -> Users (or with sudo -u zorcam-nvr python3 /opt/zorcam-nvr/gallery/zorcam_users.py set NAME ROLE)

